                      CURRICULUM VITAE (ACADEMIC PROFILE)
========================================================================
PROF. DR. AHMED AL-MANSOURI
Editor-in-Chief, IST Online Journal
Professor, Faculty of Information Technology, University of Tripoli, Libya
Email: a.mansouri@istjournal.ly / ahmed.mansouri@it.uot.edu.ly
Research Profile: Artificial Intelligence, Deep Learning & Distributed Systems
========================================================================

BIOGRAPHY:
Prof. Dr. Ahmed Al-Mansouri is a distinguished academician and researcher 
with over 25 years of experience in higher education and scientific research. 
His research bridges key domains in Artificial Intelligence, Distributed Computing, 
and Information Science. As the Editor-in-Chief of the IST Online Journal, 
he oversees peer-review quality and promotes the open-access initiative.

EDUCATION:
- Ph.D. in Computer Science & Artificial Intelligence
  University of Manchester, UK (2001)
  Thesis: "Neural Network Architectures for Multimodal Signal Processing"
- M.Sc. in Computer Engineering
  University of Belgrade, Serbia (1995)
- B.Sc. in Electrical & Electronic Engineering (High Distinction)
  University of Tripoli, Libya (1991)

ACADEMIC APPOINTMENTS & ROLES:
- Professor & Head of Artificial Intelligence Research Group
  University of Tripoli (2012 - Present)
- Associate Professor, Department of Computer Science
  University of Tripoli (2006 - 2012)
- Assistant Professor & Dean of Information Technology Faculty
  University of Tripoli (2002 - 2006)
- Research Fellow in AI & Deep Learning
  University of Manchester, UK (1998 - 2001)

REPRESENTATIVE RESEARCH PUBLICATIONS:
