2. Al-Mansouri, A. (2021). "A Hybrid Reinforcement Learning Model for Adaptive
   Cloud Load Balancing." Journal of Network and Computer Applications, 185, 103-115.
3. Al-Mansouri, A., & Zahraa, F. (2020). "Explainable AI in Medical Informatics:
   Deep Diagnostic Classifiers." Artificial Intelligence in Medicine, 108, 101-114.
4. Al-Mansouri, A. (2018). "Meta-heuristic Optimization Algorithms for Edge
